---
// Technical "selected work" for the freelance profile. No WIP card.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="work-head">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">Selected work</p>
    </div>

    <article class="project reveal">
      <div class="ptop">
        <h3><a href="https://tradingmindos.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trading Mind OS ↗</a></h3>
        <span class="tag tag--live">Live</span>
      </div>
      <p>A trading-psychology SaaS, designed and built solo, end to end. Authentication, a Postgres backend with row-level security, a configurable dashboard, a multi-currency system, a server-side Anthropic API integration, and a custom MetaTrader 5 bridge that syncs live trades into the platform.</p>
      <div class="stack-line">React · Vite · Supabase / PostgreSQL · Cloudflare · Anthropic API · MetaTrader 5</div>
    </article>

    <article class="project reveal">
      <div class="ptop">
        <h3><a href="https://taxi-pontremoli.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Taxi Pontremoli ↗</a></h3>
        <span class="tag tag--live">Live</span>
      </div>
      <p>A complete production website for a local business, delivered end to end: fast, SEO-optimized, and deployed on Cloudflare.</p>
      <div class="stack-line">Astro · Tailwind CSS · Cloudflare Pages · Technical SEO</div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
